nd thing was that CO4 had no questions at all.","”"],["P",{"class":"mt-auto text-xs text-sage-500"},"Course coordinator · Database Systems"]],["DIV",{"class":"landing-reveal  rounded-[1.5rem] bg-sage-100 p-6 flex flex-col gap-4 hover:bg-white hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-elevated transition-all duration-300","style":"transition-delay: 120ms;"},["svg",{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"24","height":"24","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","stroke-width":"2","stroke-linecap":"round","stroke-linejoin":"round","class":"lucide lucide-quote w-6 h-6 text-accent","aria-hidden":"true"},["path",{"d":"M16 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2 1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1 6 6 0 0 0 6-6V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z"}],["path",{"d":"M5 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2 1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1 6 6 0 0 0 6-6V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z"}]],["P",{"class":"font-serif text-lg leading-snug text-sage-800"},"“","Outcome coverage used to live in a spreadsheet that was out of date the moment someone edited a paper. Now every version carries its own CO/PO evidence.","”"],["P",{"class":"mt-auto text-xs text-sage-500"},"Program accreditation lead"]],["DIV",{"class":"landing-reveal  rounded-[1.5rem] bg-sage-100 p-6 flex flex-col gap-4 hover:bg-white hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-elevated transition-all duration-300","style":"transition-delay: 240ms;"},["svg",{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"24","height":"24","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","stroke-width":"2","stroke-linecap":"round","stroke-linejoin":"round","class":"lucide lucide-quote w-6 h-6 text-accent","aria-hidden":"true"},["path",{"d":"M16 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2 1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1 6 6 0 0 0 6-6V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z"}],["path",{"d":"M5 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2 1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1 6 6 0 0 0 6-6V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z"}]],["P",{"class":"font-serif text-lg leading-snug text-sage-800"},"“","I was worried the AI would rewrite my exam. It never touches it. It shows me what it sees and lets me decide — that is exactly the relationship I wanted.","”"],["P",{"class":"mt-auto text-xs text-sage-500"},"Lecturer · first semester using FacultyLens"]]]]],["SECTION",{"class":"bg-white border-t border-sage-200/70"},["DIV",{"class":"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 sm:py-20 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10"},["DIV",{"class":"landing-reveal  lg:col-span-4 space-y-4","style":"transition-delay: 0ms;"},["H2",{"class":"font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-[2.75rem] leading-[1.1] tracking-tight text-sage-800 "},"Straight answers."],["P",{"class":"text-sm sm:text-base text-sage-500 leading-relaxed "},"The questions we hear before anyone uploads their first paper — answered the way the system actually behaves."]],["DIV",{"class":"landing-reveal  lg:col-span-8","style":"transition-delay: 120ms;"},["UL",{"class":"border-t border-sage-200"},["LI",{"class":"border-b border-sage-200"},["BUTTON",{"type":"button","aria-expanded":"true","class":"w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-4 py-4 text-left text-sm sm:text-base text-sage-800 hover:text-sage-600 transition-colors"},["SPAN",{"class":"font-medium"},"Does FacultyLens change my questions, marks or grades automatically?"],["svg",{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"24","height":"24","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","stroke-width":"2","stroke-linecap":"round","stroke-linejoin":"round","class":"lucide lucide-chevron-down w-4 h-4 shrink-0 text-sage-400 transition-transform duration-300 rotate-180","aria-hidden":"true"},["path",{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"}]]],["DIV",{"class":"grid transition-all duration-300 ease-out grid-rows-[1fr] opacity-100 pb-4"},["P",{"class":"overflow-hidden text-sm text-sage-500 leading-relaxed max-w-3xl"},"No. Every recommendation, generated question, rubric and grading suggestion is a proposal. Nothing becomes part of the assessment or a student record until a faculty member approves it, and finalized versions can never be edited in place."]]],["LI",{"class":"border-b border-sage-200"},["BUTTON",{"type":"button","aria-expanded":"false","class":"w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-4 py-4 text-left text-sm sm:text-base text-sage-800 hover:text-sage-600 transition-colors"},["SPAN",{"class":"font-medium"},"How are quality scores calculated?"],["svg",{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"24","height":"24","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","stroke-width":"2","stroke-linecap":"round","stroke-linejoin":"round","class":"lucide lucide-chevron-down w-4 h-4 shrink-0 text-sage-400 transition-transform duration-300","aria-hidden":"true"},["path",{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"}]]],["DIV",{"class":"grid transition-all duration-300 ease-out grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0"},["P",{"class":"overflow-hidden text-sm text-sage-500 leading-relaxed max-w-3xl"},"Six deterministic dimensions — topic coverage, learning-outcome alignment, difficulty balance, cognitive diversity, similarity and question diversity — are computed from your paper and shown individually. The overall score is a weighted roll-up of those dimensions, never an opaque number."]]],["LI",{"class":"border-b border-sage-200"},["BUTTON",{"type":"button","aria-expanded":"false","class":"w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-4 py-4 text-left text-sm sm:text-base text-sage-800 hover:text-sage-600 transition-colors"},["SPAN",{"class":"font-medium"},"What happens to historical analyses when I revise an assessment?"],["svg",{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"24","height":"24","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","stroke-width":"2","stroke-linecap":"round","stroke-linejoin":"round","class":"lucide lucide-chevron-down w-4 h-4 shrink-0 text-sage-400 transition-transform duration-300","aria-hidden":"true"},["path",{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"}]]],["DIV",{"class":"grid transition-all duration-300 ease-out grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0"},["P",{"class":"overflow-hidden text-sm text-sage-500 leading-relaxed max-w-3xl"},"Each analysis is attached to the exact assessment version it examined. Revising a paper creates a new version; earlier analyses, reports and student submissions stay bound to their original snapshot."]]],["LI",{"class":"border-b border-sage-200"},["BUTTON",{"type":"button","aria-expanded":"false","class":"w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-4 py-4 text-left text-sm sm:text-base text-sage-800 hover:text-sage-600 transition-colors"},["SPAN",{"class":"font-medium"},"Can colleagues review a paper without being able to edit it?"],["svg",{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"24","height":"24","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","stroke-width":"2","stroke-linecap":"round","stroke-linejoin":"round","class":"lucide lucide-chevron-down w-4 h-4 shrink-0 text-sage-400 transition-transform duration-300","aria-hidden":"true"},["path",{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"}]]],["DIV",{"class":"grid transition-all duration-300 ease-out grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0"},["P",{"class":"overflow-hidden text-sm text-sage-500 leading-relaxed max-w-3xl"},"Yes. Invite them as reviewers or viewers. They can read, comment and compare versions; only owners and editors can change drafts, approve or finalize."]]],["LI",{"class":"border-b border-sage-200"},["BUTTON",{"type":"button","aria-expanded":"false","class":"w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-4 py-4 text-left text-sm sm:text-base text-sage-800 hover:text-sage-600 transition-colors"},["SPAN",{"class":"font-medium"},"Where does my course data go?"],["svg",{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"24","height":"24","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","stroke-width":"2","stroke-linecap":"round","stroke-linejoin":"round","class":"lucide lucide-chevron-down w-4 h-4 shrink-0 text-sage-400 transition-transform duration-300","aria-hidden":"true"},["path",{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"}]]],["DIV",{"class":"grid transition-all duration-300 ease-out grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0"},["P",{"class":"overflow-hidden text-sm text-sage-500 leading-relaxed max-w-3xl"},"Documents, questions and student answers are stored in your institution’s FacultyLens deployment and scoped to the course. Audit logs never store question text or student answers."]]]]]]],["SECTION",{"id":"pricing","class":"bg-white"},["DIV",{"class":"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pb-16"},["DIV",{"class":"landing-reveal  ","style":"transition-delay: 0ms;"},["DIV",{"class":"relative overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] bg-sage-700 text-white px-6 sm:px-10 py-10 flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center gap-8"},["svg",{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"24","height":"24","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","stroke-width":"2","stroke-linecap":"round","stroke-linejoin":"round","class":"lucide lucide-leaf landing-float absolute -left-4 -bottom-6 w-32 h-32 text-white/10","aria-hidden":"true"},["path",{"d":"M11 20A7 7 0 0 1 9.8 6.1C15.5 5 17 4.48 19 2c1 2 2 4.18 2 8 0 5.5-4.78 10-10 10Z"}],["path",{"d":"M2 21c0-3 1.85-5.36 5.08-6C9.5 14.52 12 13 13 12"}]],["DIV",{"class":"hidden md:block w-24 shrink-0"}],["DIV",{"class":"flex-1 space-y-2 relative"},["P",{"class":"text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-sage-700 !text-sage-300"},"Built for Academic Excellence"],["H2",{"class":"font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl tracking-tight"},"AI assists. ",["SPAN",{"class":"text-sage-300"},"Faculty decides."]],["P",{"class":"text-sm text-white/85 max-w-xl"},"Upload one assessment and see its quality, alignment and similarity picture in minutes — no automatic changes, no lock-in, every decision left to you."],["P",{"class":"text-xs text-white/70 flex flex-wrap gap-x-4"},["SPAN",{},"Explainable"],["SPAN",{},"·"],["SPAN",{},"Private"],["SPAN",{},"·"],["SPAN",{},"Auditable"]]],["BUTTON",{"type":"button","class":"group inline-flex items-center gap-2 w